<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <style>
        body { font-family: Arial, sans-serif; background: #f4f4f4; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        .wrapper { max-width: 600px; margin: 40px auto; background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; overflow: hidden; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); }
        .header { background: #d9534f; padding: 30px; text-align: center; }
        .header h1 { color: #fff; margin: 0; font-size: 24px; }
        .body { padding: 30px; color: #333; line-height: 1.7; }
        .detail-box { background: #f9f9f9; border-left: 4px solid #d9534f; padding: 15px 20px; margin: 20px 0; border-radius: 0 4px 4px 0; }
        .footer { background: #f4f4f4; padding: 15px 30px; text-align: center; font-size: 12px; color: #888; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="wrapper">
        <div class="header">
            <h1>Application Status Update</h1>
        </div>
        <div class="body">
            <p>Dear {{ applicantName }},</p>
            <p>
                Thank you for your interest. After careful review, we regret to inform you that your
                application for the following opportunity has not been selected at this time:
            </p>
            <div class="detail-box">
                <strong>Position:</strong> {{ opportunity.title }}<br>
                {% if opportunity.company %}
                    <strong>Company:</strong> {{ opportunity.company.name }}<br>
                {% endif %}
                <strong>Type:</strong> {{ opportunity.type|capitalize }}
            </div>
            <p>
                We encourage you to keep an eye on new opportunities and continue building your profile.
                Don't be discouraged — the right opportunity is out there!
            </p>
            <p>Best of luck, the MindForge team.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            © MindForge — This is an automated notification, please do not reply to this email.
        </div>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
